WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.460
Let's say a specific agricultural supplier

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.200
calls you in a panic and

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.680
informs you that a massive batch

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.000
of raw ingredients was contaminated.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.080
Ooh, a recall situation.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.680
Right. You need to instantly trace

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.200
that supplier's exposure through your

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.680
entire global supply chain.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.620
Which specific intermediate products

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.100
contain that batch, which exact multimodal

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.000
shipments carried those products, which

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.700
which specific retail stores received

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.240
those shipments and which exact refrigeration

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.440
units are currently holding them on

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:25.840
the floor.
